  "notes": "{規制|きせい} refers to official regulations and restrictions.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{規制|きせい}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {規制|きせい}する (to regulate, restrict)\n- {規制|きせい}を{設|もう}ける (to establish regulations)\n- {規制|きせい}を{緩和|かんわ}する (to ease regulations)\n- {規制|きせい}を{強化|きょうか}する (to strengthen regulations)\n\nTYPES:\n- {交通|こうつう}{規制|きせい} (traffic restrictions)\n- {環境|かんきょう}{規制|きせい} (environmental regulations)\n- {価格|かかく}{規制|きせい} (price controls)\n- {自主|じしゅ}{規制|きせい} (self-regulation)\n\nCOMPOUND WORDS:\n- {規制|きせい}{緩和|かんわ} (deregulation)\n- {規制|きせい}{当局|とうきょく} (regulatory authority)",
